fpga_py_exension.c
    A C extension to Python3 for low level functions and for
    links to others in fpga.c.

fpga.c
fpga.h
    low level functions for AXI/FPGA access.

mk_setup
    Script to execute setup.py and to compile fpga.c

setup.py
    links fpga_py_extension.c into the python3 library.
